    "title": "Ford Otosan · historical funding review",
    "question": "What does the April 2024 published funding plan support, and which access and cash-use assumptions change its coverage?",
    "issuer_aliases": [
      "Ford Otosan"
    ],
    "scope": "Historical Ford Otomotiv Sanayi A.S. (Ford Otosan), April 11, 2024. Bounded published-plan funding intake from actual retained handoffs. Plan covers 2024 starting January 1; not twelve months from the April review. Displayed rounded TRY-billion components use the full up-to-2 working-capital swing. Proposed bond proceeds and purpose-specific capex facility availability remain conditional; dividend overlay and exactly-15% capex mitigation are separate stipulated cases, not actual failures or the agency working model. TRY-million forecasts remain separate. Complete maturities, operative documents, unrestricted access, refinancing/LME feasibility, creditor treatment and outcomes remain unassessed. Retained-response replay, not fresh model/provider/native acceptance. Excel is an analytical input only; no workbook output."
